# TarkBuzz

WIP prototype for screen-based haptics in Escape from Tarkov.

18+ NSFW Warning

TarkBuzz is a tool that reads the game screen and turns in-game damage indicators into vibration output for Buttplug-compatible devices.

This project does not touch game files or game memory. It only reads what is on screen, which is the safest approach for a visual detection tool.

Please refer to the Interface Central documentation before setting this up and using it in-game.

## What this does

- reads the health UI from the game screen
- detects visual damage states
- converts those states into vibration output
- works as a safer, screen-based alternative to direct game integration

## Game requirements

- Health Condition must be set to "Always Shown"
- Health Condition should be set to "polychrome"
- This project is intended for Windows 
